  "title": "On calibrated representations and the Plancherel Theorem for a\ufb03ne Hecke algebras",
  "authors_raw": "James Parkinson\u2217",
  "title_lines": [
   "On calibrated representations and the Plancherel Theorem for",
   "affine Hecke algebras"
  ],
  "abstract": "This paper has two main purposes. Firstly we generalise Ram\u2019s combinatorial construc- tion [23] of calibrated representations of the a\ufb03ne Hecke algebra to the multi-parameter case (including the non-reduced BCn case). We then derive the Plancherel formulae for all rank 1 and rank 2 a\ufb03ne Hecke algebras, using our calibrated representations to construct all representations involved.",
